# A WING UNDER THE LID (docs/ABOVE.md §2, fliers): off a ledge under the caves'
# roof on the real key, over the shoulder. The wing is held its own height under
# the underside (AbilityMotion glide), so the flight runs out under the rock and
# comes down in the hall, never up into the roof.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/glide-under-roof.tour --seed=7 --realm=underground --hour=12 --fit=glide_wing
coast calm
wait 1.0
near glide_under_roof
wait 1.0
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
await above_whole 3
wait 1.0
shot 01-at-the-lip-under-the-lid with shoulder
tap ability_glide
await ability:glide 4
wait 0.5
shot 02-gliding-under-the-lid with gliding, shoulder
wait 0.8
shot 03-further-out-under-it with shoulder
wait 6.0
shot 04-down-in-the-hall with shoulder
